<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<GameData>
	<Language_ko_KR>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_MERCENARIES_DESCRIPTION">
			<Text>Barbarian Service</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_MERCENARIES_HELP">
			<Text>A band of barbarians, fresh from some foreign war now settled, has arrived at our city, and offer their services to the locals. These are no mere barbarians; these are professional scourge of the lands. If not aligned toward us, then they see us as something else...</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_MERCENARIES_CHOICE_1">
			<Text>Turn them away! We shall have no barbarian brutes in our armies.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_MERCENARIES_CHOICE_1_HELP">
			<Text>[ICON_BULLET][COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Gain {2_InstantYield}[ENDCOLOR][NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET][COLOR_NEGATIVE_TEXT]Barbarians are insulted and attack you![NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET][COLOR_RESEARCH_STORED]+1 [ICON_FLOWER] Morality[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_MERCENARIES_CHOICE_2">
			<Text> We must direct them somewhere before they pillage us!</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_MERCENARIES_CHOICE_3">
			<Text>Ah, my kind of soldiers! Pay them and bring them into our service.</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_CITY_EVENT_MERCENARIES_CHOICE_3_HELP">
			<Text>[ICON_BULLET][COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]Gain two free units[ENDCOLOR][NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET][COLOR_NEGATIVE_TEXT]Lose {2_InstantYield} [NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET][COLOR_WARNING_TEXT]-1 [ICON_OCCUPIED] Morality[ENDCOLOR]</Text>
		</Row>	
	</Language_ko_KR>
</GameData>